{"id":"steam-809430","steam":809430,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"The Floor is Lava","summary":"The Floor is Lava is a parkour and adventure game with mountains, rocks and even floating objects that defy the law of physics! But remember, if you fall in the lava. You'll have to do it all again!","about":"\"The Floor Is Lava\" is a game made to be light, funny and fun to play with friends in multiplayer mode or even play story mode!\r\n\r\n\"The Floor is Lava\" is a parkour and adventure game with mountains, rocks and even floating objects that defy the law of physics! But remember, if you fall in the lava. You'll have to do it all again!\r\n\r\n\"The Floor is Lava\" is in addition to being a game that defies the laws of physics, it also defies other laws like the law of floating over some objects to make your game a little easier, because I did not want to speak anything but pretty hard!\r\n\r\n\"The Floor is Lava\" is love, happiness and all that good! So please buy this game I never asked for anything! (I love you)\r\n\r\n(This is the first Cat Launch Studio game, I hope you like it!)","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/809430/portrait.png?t=1583926200","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/809430/header.jpg?t=1583926200","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/809430/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1583926200","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/809430/header.jpg?t=1583926200","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/809430/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1583926200","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/809430/ss_cc0192593684b9c83fc7dcaf9f8391b5f37be2f6.600x338.jpg?t=1583926200","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/809430/ss_cc0192593684b9c83fc7dcaf9f8391b5f37be2f6.jpg?t=158